{
  "_readme": [
    "Per-object-type contextual action menus for the reader, and the",
    "per-taxonomy-section extension mechanism the project lead asked for",
    "directly: 'if it is something in Veda, it can have additional",
    "contextual menu like whether the svara is anudatta, udatta, or",
    "svarita... If it is in the context of Ashtadhyayi, something else can",
    "come... All these should be mappable. We can enable it, disable it,",
    "map it.'",
    "",
    "Read by dge/js/contextual-actions.js at boot. If this file is missing",
    "or malformed, only the hardcoded base actions in that file are used —",
    "nothing crashes, matching admin/config/menu.json's own convention.",
    "",
    "  base              the default action list per object type (shloka,",
    "                    word, phrase, commentary, reference, chapter,",
    "                    page). Every reader sees these unless overridden.",
    "  taxonomyOverrides  a list of { id, pathPrefixes, objectTypes, add,",
    "                    remove, enabled }. pathPrefixes match against",
    "                    window.currentGranthaSlug (e.g. 'vedas/rigveda/',",
    "                    library.json's own taxonomy path convention — see",
    "                    dgeGranthaSlug() in dge/js/core.js). 'add' appends",
    "                    extra actions; 'remove' hides a base action id for",
    "                    that section. Set enabled:false to switch a whole",
    "                    override off without deleting it.",
    "  action            a function name on window, called with (context)",
    "                    where context = { objectType, granthaSlug,",
    "                    shlokaId, text, el }.",
    "  requires           optional: 'admin' or 'superadmin', same gate",
    "                    convention as menu.json — hides the action from",
    "                    ordinary readers.",
    "",
    "This is intentionally a thin, admin-editable data file (same pattern",
    "as menu.json/keys.json) — new taxonomy branches (Ashtadhyayi sutra",
    "actions, Nyaya pramana actions, etc.) are future work and get added",
    "here without touching dge/js/contextual-actions.js itself. A page can",
    "also register actions at runtime via window.dgeRegisterContextualActions()",
    "for logic too dynamic to express as static data."
  ],

  "objectTypes": ["shloka", "word", "phrase", "commentary", "reference", "chapter", "page"],

  "base": {
    "shloka": [
      { "id": "favorite",    "icon": "star",     "label": "Favorite",              "action": "dgeCtxToggleFavorite" },
      { "id": "status",      "icon": "status",   "label": "Reading status",        "action": "dgeCtxOpenStatusPicker" },
      { "id": "doubt",       "icon": "doubt",    "label": "Mark doubt",            "action": "dgeCtxToggleDoubt" },
      { "id": "copy",        "icon": "copy",     "label": "Copy",                  "action": "dgeCtxCopyShloka" },
      { "id": "play",        "icon": "play",     "label": "Play",                  "action": "dgeCtxPlayShloka" },
      { "id": "askAcharya",  "icon": "acharya",  "label": "Explain this shloka",   "action": "dgeCtxAskAcharyaShloka" },
      { "id": "references",  "icon": "link",     "label": "References",           "action": "dgeCtxShowReferences" },
      { "id": "more",        "icon": "more",     "label": "More",                  "action": "dgeCtxOpenMoreSheet" }
    ],
    "word": [
      { "id": "dictionary",  "icon": "book",     "label": "Dictionary",            "action": "dgeCtxOpenShabda" },
      { "id": "morphology",  "icon": "puzzle",   "label": "Morphology",            "action": "dgeCtxOpenDhatu" },
      { "id": "search",      "icon": "search",   "label": "Search corpus",         "action": "dgeCtxSearchCorpus" },
      { "id": "copy",        "icon": "copy",     "label": "Copy",                  "action": "dgeCtxCopySelection" },
      { "id": "askAcharya",  "icon": "acharya",  "label": "Ask about this word",   "action": "dgeCtxAskAcharyaWord" },
      { "id": "studyList",   "icon": "add",      "label": "Add to study list",     "action": "dgeCtxAddToStudyList" }
    ],
    "phrase": [
      { "id": "copy",        "icon": "copy",     "label": "Copy",                  "action": "dgeCtxCopySelection" },
      { "id": "search",      "icon": "search",   "label": "Search corpus",         "action": "dgeCtxSearchCorpus" },
      { "id": "askAcharya",  "icon": "acharya",  "label": "Ask about this phrase", "action": "dgeCtxAskAcharyaPhrase" }
    ],
    "commentary": [
      { "id": "copy",        "icon": "copy",     "label": "Copy commentary",       "action": "dgeCtxCopyCommentary" },
      { "id": "askAcharya",  "icon": "acharya",  "label": "Explain this commentary", "action": "dgeCtxAskAcharyaCommentary" },
      { "id": "references",  "icon": "link",     "label": "References",           "action": "dgeCtxShowReferences" }
    ],
    "reference": [
      { "id": "open",        "icon": "open",     "label": "Open in DGE",           "action": "dgeCtxOpenReference" },
      { "id": "askAcharya",  "icon": "acharya",  "label": "Explain this reference","action": "dgeCtxAskAcharyaReference" }
    ],
    "chapter": [
      { "id": "bookmark",    "icon": "bookmark", "label": "Bookmark chapter",      "action": "dgeCtxBookmarkChapter" },
      { "id": "summarize",   "icon": "acharya",  "label": "Summarize this chapter","action": "dgeCtxAskAcharyaChapter" },
      { "id": "search",      "icon": "search",   "label": "Search within text",    "action": "dgeCtxSearchWithinText" }
    ],
    "page": [
      { "id": "bookmark",    "icon": "bookmark", "label": "Bookmark page",         "action": "dgeCtxBookmarkPage" },
      { "id": "search",      "icon": "search",   "label": "Search within text",    "action": "dgeCtxSearchWithinText" },
      { "id": "typography",  "icon": "type",     "label": "Display / Typography",  "action": "dgeCtxOpenDisplaySettings" },
      { "id": "audio",       "icon": "audio",    "label": "Audio",                 "action": "dgeCtxOpenAudioPanel" },
      { "id": "export",      "icon": "export",   "label": "Export / copy",         "action": "dgeCtxExportPage" },
      { "id": "references",  "icon": "link",     "label": "References",           "action": "dgeCtxShowReferences" },
      { "id": "edit",        "icon": "edit",     "label": "Edit",                  "action": "dgeCtxEnterEditMode", "requires": "admin" },
      { "id": "more",        "icon": "more",     "label": "More",                  "action": "dgeCtxOpenMoreSheet" }
    ]
  },

  "taxonomyOverrides": [
    {
      "id": "veda-svara",
      "label": "Vedic accent (svara) tools",
      "pathPrefixes": ["vedas/"],
      "objectTypes": ["word", "phrase"],
      "enabled": true,
      "add": [
        { "id": "svara", "icon": "svara", "label": "Svara (accent)", "action": "dgeCtxShowSvaraInfo" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
